1300 GOSUB 6160:BM$="Officer: Could you please interrupt the concert? At this rate, it won't be\long before we start having casualties...":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1310 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: If we interrupt the concert without warning, the audience will go\crazy. Then we'll DEFINITELY have casualties.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1320 GOSUB 6160:BM$="Officer: I'm calling for backup. Hopefully there won't be any casualties by\the time they get here... Can you at least turn the music down?":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1330 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: Look at them, officer. They're not even listening to the music any\more. It's the SONG itself that fuels them.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1340 GOSUB 6160:BM$="Officer: Work with me here, okay? I'd rather not have to fire my gun.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1350 GOSUB 6340:BM$="Susanna: I'll see what I can do.":GOSUB 5100
1360 ISET X:BM$="Susanna herself was worried about the crowd going berserk. Lost in\thought, she gazed upon David, who was standing at the very edge of the\stage.":GOSUB 5100
1370 GOSUB 6150:BM$="During the song's interlude, David approached Susanna.":GOSUB 5100
1380 BM$="David: I'm doing great, Susanna!":GOSUB 5100
1390 BM$="Susanna: You're on fire tonight, David!":GOSUB 5100
1400 BM$="Susanna: Sing the next song for me. Make it something sweet and kind...":GOSUB 5100
1410 BM$="David: OK! Let the others know. Once this song's over, have them turn down\the lights.":GOSUB 5100
1420 BM$="David returned to the stage.":GOSUB 5100
1425 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6170:FOR I=0 TO 3000:NEXT:GOSUB 5822
1430 GOSUB 9515:BM$="The song ended, and the lights went down. The crowd was getting more and\more agitated as their surroundings grew darker.":GOSUB 5100
1440 BM$="A slow and calm intro started playing. The audience didn't calm down\however, as if they weren't actually listening.":GOSUB 5100
1450 ISET X:BM$="When David started singing, everything changed. The crowd stopped\screaming and moving. They religiously listened to his voice.":GOSUB 5100
1460 BM$="Clark and Vince were once again attending the concert.":GOSUB 5100
1465 GOSUB 1500
1466 CM=2:G1=0:G2=0:CM$(1)="Clark spoke.":CM$(2)="Vince spoke."
1470 GOSUB 5400
1486 IF CN=2 AND G1>1 THEN 1540
