1500 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Why are they changing the song? I liked the other one better.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1510 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: Because they're not complete morons. Had they kept going with the\same energy, someone would have died tonight.":GOSUB 5100:RETURN
1520 GOSUB 6320:BM$="Vince: Eh, what's the big deal. People die every day.":GOSUB 5100
1530 GOSUB 6310:BM$="Clark: Yeah, this one's good. I'm actually enjoying this one. Who knew David\could sing like this?":GOSUB 5100
1540 GOSUB 6176:BM$="Before long, the venue fell silent. Men and women were kissing while David\sang.":GOSUB 5100
1550 COMMON FO:GOSUB 5823:BM$="The song ended, and the lights were dimmed even further.":GOSUB 5100
1560 GOSUB 9535:BM$="Audience: Encore! Encore! Encore! ...":GOSUB 5100
1570 GOSUB 9040:GOSUB 5821:ISET X:BM$="The lights on the stage were turned on once again, all at once. The beat of\the synths filled the venue once more. The audience cheered, as the\performance changed from calm to energetic once more.":GOSUB 5100
1580 COMMON FO:BM$="Their frenzy began anew, but never with the same intensity as earlier.\There was no longer a risk of casualties.":GOSUB 5100
1590 GOSUB 5200:BM$="Overall, the concert in Rome was a success.":GOSUB 5100
